>       Transcript-Hash(M1, M2, ... Mn) = Hash(M1 || M2 || ... ||
Truncate(Mn))

Messages never include themselves in the transcript hash. There
is a truncated case, but it is handled differently, with the
message passed in as pre-truncated.

